        "instruction": {
          "title": "Geocentric explanation: epicycles and parsimony",
          "description": "Open the geocentric comparison panel. In a geocentric model, Mars's loop must be added by an epicycle. This can reproduce the observation, but it is less simple than the heliocentric explanation."
        },
